  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Vjournal backend by @mathstuf in https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/pull/608\r\n* editor: snap to line start/end when vertical nav would be a no-op by @kotachisam in https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/pull/628\r\n* feat(settings,ui): add auto_title config for pre-populating new-entry title by @kotachisam in https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/pull/622\r\n* entries_list_cmd: use `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` when available by @mathstuf in https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/pull/640\r\n* Update dependencies by @AmmarAbouZor in https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/pull/654\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AmmarAbouZor/tui-journal/compare/v0.17.0...v0.18.0",
